					"id": "teft0eAgWqoR8CTxu",
					"name": "Faction Affiliation (@Faction@)",
					"local_notes": "This is the lowest level of associate with a Guild, House, or other faction. You have a Claim to Hospitality with the faction, but they do not act as a Patron and you have no meaningful Duties towards them. The faction will give you a place to sleep and some basic subsistence, as well as basic jobs, but will do little for you beyond this. However, rivals of your faction will regard you negatively.",
					"tags": [
						"Perk",
						"Social"
					],
