					"id": "txyNwcTRMmRg26j9y",
					"name": "Potion Tolerance",
					"local_notes": "You’ve built up a tolerance to the strange side effects of potions and alchemical concoctions. When you drink more than one potion within a 10-minute period, you gain a +2 bonus on the HT roll to resist nausea (B428).\n\nThis perk may represent careful conditioning, years of exposure to alchemical brews, or simply an unusually hardy stomach.",
					"tags": [
						"Perk",
						"Physical"
					],
